description: Keep docs synchronized with the product
globs: docs/**/*.md
---

# Documentation

- Context files in `docs/` (especially `docs/project-context.md`) and root `AGENTS.md` are living documents. Update them when architecture or shipped scope changes.
- Plans belong only in `docs/plans/`. Never write them outside this repository.
- ADRs in `docs/decisions/` are immutable once accepted; supersede with a new ADR instead of silently rewriting history.
